# Ignore generated asset sources, but keep the full-resolution face masters
# committed: a durable backup of the 33 avatars, which cannot be regenerated
# without OpenAI credits. The raw 1024px PNGs stay ignored (42 MB); these q95
# WebPs are visually identical at 4 MB and re-derive every shipped size.
assets/*
!assets/faces/
assets/faces/*
!assets/faces/*.webp
